    {
      "tag": "Go",
      "h2": "Gehen — To Go",
      "body_html": "<p>For activities like swimming use <strong>gehen</strong>: 'Ich gehe schwimmen' (I go swimming). Pattern works for skating, climbing too.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Time",
      "h2": "How Often",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>Oft</strong> = often. <strong>Jeden Tag</strong> = every day. 'Ich spiele oft Fussball' = 'I often play football'.</p>"
